{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2371", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2371/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2371/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2371/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2371", "id": 2460870526, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6Sred-", "number": 2371, "title": "Bug in battery.cpp example", "user": {"login": "KarthiAru", "id": 8588253, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODgyNTM=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8588253?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru", "html_url": "https://github.com/KarthiAru", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KarthiAru/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2024-08-12T12:31:25Z", "updated_at": "2024-08-13T12:15:58Z", "closed_at": "2024-08-13T12:15:58Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Hi,\r\n\r\nWhen examining the [battery.cpp](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/examples/battery/battery.cpp#L92-L93) example while utilizing the SITL (Gazebo) setup, I observed that the battery statistics were not being updated for the default 'System 1'. Instead, these updates were associated with a new 'System 245'. \r\n\r\nUpon further investigation, I discovered that the values for `mavlink_address.system_id` and `mavlink_address.component_id` were not correctly defined, which appears to be the root cause of the issue.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3397ae1-2891-4766-a449-cf8bf8a135a8)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76dc5abd-7446-4a22-8059-04fccae3d065)\r\n\r\n```\r\nbattery/build \ue0b0 \ue0a0 main \ue0b0 ./battery udp://:14540                                   \r\n[05:56:12|Info ] MAVSDK version: v2.12.2-60-ga428ee99 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:28)\r\n[05:56:12|Warn ] Connection using udp:// is deprecated, please use udpin:// or udpout:// (cli_arg.cpp:28)\r\n[05:56:12|Info ] New system on: 127.0.0.1:14580 (with system ID: 1) (udp_connection.cpp:179)\r\n[05:56:12|Debug] New system ID: 1 Comp ID: 1 (mavsdk_impl.cpp:705)\r\n[05:56:12|Debug] Component Autopilot (1) added. (system_impl.cpp:367)\r\n[05:56:12|Warn ] Vehicle type changed (new type: 2, old type: 0) (system_impl.cpp:218)\r\n[05:56:12|Debug] Discovered 1 component(s) (system_impl.cpp:510)\r\nSending battery status with System ID: \ufffd and Component ID: \ufffd\r\narmed\r\nSending battery status with System ID: \ufffd and Component ID: \ufffd\r\narmed\r\nSending battery status with System ID: \ufffd and Component ID: \ufffd\r\n```", "closed_by": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "h